<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Wayfarer | 시작하라, 그럼 바뀔 것이다</title>

<meta name="description" content="여행 기록, 컴퓨터 수리·상담, 반려토끼 토토의 일상을 담은 Wayfarer 홈페이지입니다.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#F6F8FB">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Wayfarer | 시작하라, 그럼 바뀔 것이다">
<meta property="og:description" content="여행 기록, 컴퓨터 수리·상담, 반려토끼 토토의 일상을 담은 Wayfarer 홈페이지입니다.">

<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ctext y='.9em' font-size='90'%3E%F0%9F%A7%AD%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css">

<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #F6F8FB;
    --surface: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
    --surface-soft: rgba(255,255,255,.62);
    --surface-glass: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    --text: #1F2937;
    --text-strong: #0F172A;
    --muted: #64748B;

    --travel: #FF6B35;
    --travel-soft: rgba(255,107,53,.12);
    --repair: #10B981;
    --repair-soft: rgba(16,185,129,.12);
    --bunny: #EC4899;
    --bunny-soft: rgba(236,72,153,.12);

    --border: rgba(15,23,42,.08);
    --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
    --radius: 24px;
    --font: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Noto Sans KR', 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] {
    --bg: #070B14;
    --surface: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    --surface-soft: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    --surface-glass: rgba(10,15,28,.78);
    --text: #E2E8F0;
    --text-strong: #FFFFFF;
    --muted: #94A3B8;

    --travel-soft: rgba(255,107,53,.14);
    --repair-soft: rgba(16,185,129,.14);
    --bunny-soft: rgba(236,72,153,.14);

    --border: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    --shadow: 0 22px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }

  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: var(--font);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 8%, rgba(255,107,53,.10), transparent 28%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 4%, rgba(16,185,129,.10), transparent 26%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 72% 86%, rgba(236,72,153,.08), transparent 30%),
      var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    word-break: keep-all;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  button, input, textarea { font-family: inherit; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  section[id] { scroll-margin-top: 88px; }

  .container {
    width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .parallax-section {
    background-attachment: fixed;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-size: cover;
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.66), rgba(246,248,251,.90));
    z-index: 1;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .overlay {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,11,20,.70), rgba(7,11,20,.93));
  }

  .page-view { min-height: calc(100vh - 64px); }

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: var(--surface-glass);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: box-shadow .25s ease, background .25s ease;
  }

  header.scrolled {
    box-shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
  }

  .nav {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    height: 68px;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .logo .logo-w { color: var(--travel); }
  .logo .logo-dot { color: var(--repair); }

  .nav-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 26px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    position: relative;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: .94rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 8px 2px;
    transition: color .2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 2px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--travel), var(--repair));
    transition: width .25s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover,
  .nav-links a.active {
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .nav-links a:hover::after,
  .nav-links a.active::after {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .theme-toggle,
  .menu-btn {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    color: var(--text);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }

  .theme-toggle:hover,
  .menu-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    border-color: rgba(255,107,53,.45);
  }

  .menu-btn {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    display: none;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    padding: 150px 0 130px;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero .overlay {
    z-index: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 85% at 50% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.28), transparent 62%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(246,248,251,.70), rgba(246,248,251,.94));
    backdrop-filter: saturate(1.15) blur(2px);
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .hero .overlay {
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 85% at 50% 0%, rgba(15,23,42,.30), transparent 62%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,11,20,.64), rgba(7,11,20,.94));
  }

  .hero .container { z-index: 2; }

  .orb {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 999px;
    filter: blur(90px);
    opacity: .30;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    animation: float 14s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .orb-1 {
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    left: -120px;
    top: -110px;
    background: rgba(255,107,53,.42);
  }

  .orb-2 {
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    right: -90px;
    bottom: -120px;
    background: rgba(16,185,129,.34);
    animation-delay: -5s;
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate3d(0,0,0) scale(1); }
    50% { transform: translate3d(18px,-22px,0) scale(1.06); }
  }

  .hero-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: .84rem;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .hero-badge span { color: var(--travel); }

  .hero-badge::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--travel);
    animation: pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,53,.5); }
    50%      { box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(255,107,53,0); }
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 22px auto 18px;
    font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 6vw, 4.35rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--travel), var(--repair), var(--bunny));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .hero p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .hero-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 68px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: block;
    padding: 34px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--surface), var(--surface-soft));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1), box-shadow .35s ease, border-color .35s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .hero-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 45%);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity .35s ease;
  }

  .hero-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.14);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, var(--border));
  }

  .hero-card:hover::after { opacity: 1; }

  .hero-card.travel { --accent: var(--travel); --accent-soft: var(--travel-soft); }
  .hero-card.repair { --accent: var(--repair); --accent-soft: var(--repair-soft); }
  .hero-card.bunny  { --accent: var(--bunny);  --accent-soft: var(--bunny-soft); }

  .hero-card .icon {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 18%, var(--border));
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .hero-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.32rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .hero-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .98rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .hero-card .go {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: .92rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: transform .25s ease, gap .25s ease;
  }

  .hero-card:hover .go {
    gap: 10px;
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .sec-head {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 54px;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .tag.travel { background: var(--travel-soft); color: var(--travel); }
  .tag.repair { background: var(--repair-soft); color: var(--repair); }
  .tag.bunny  { background: var(--bunny-soft);  color: var(--bunny); }

  .sec-head h2 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .back-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: .88rem;
    transition: transform .22s ease, border-color .22s ease;
  }

  .back-btn:hover {
    transform: translateX(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(255,107,53,.35);
  }

  .section-add-btn {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 950;
    font-size: .98rem;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease, filter .22s ease;
  }

  .section-add-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    filter: brightness(1.05);
  }

  .section-add-btn.travel-add {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--travel), #FF9A76);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(255,107,53,.28);
  }

  .section-add-btn.repair-add {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--repair), #34D399);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(16,185,129,.24);
  }

  .section-add-btn.bunny-add {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bunny), #F472B6);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(236,72,153,.24);
  }

  .post-grid,
  .cat-grid,
  .bunny-gallery,
  .user-post-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .user-post-grid { margin-top: 24px; }
  .contents { display: contents; }

  .post,
  .cat,
  .bunny-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 32px 26px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease, border-color .3s ease;
  }

  .post:hover,
  .cat:hover,
  .bunny-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 58px rgba(15,23,42,.12);
    border-color: rgba(255,107,53,.22);
  }

  .icon-large {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .post h3,
  .cat h3,
  .bunny-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .post p,
  .cat p,
  .bunny-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .98rem;
    line-height: 1.78;
  }

  .faq {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 54px auto 0;
  }

  .faq-item {
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 22px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .faq-item .q {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .faq-item .q::after {
    content: "+";
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--repair);
    transition: transform .25s ease;
  }

  .faq-item.open .q::after {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .faq-item .a {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height .3s ease;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
  }

  .faq-item .a p {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .96rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .contact-notice {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding: 34px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--repair);
    font-weight: 950;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--repair-soft);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--repair) 18%, var(--border));
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .pure-light-section {
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .bunny-box {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding: 34px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .bunny-box h3 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .bunny-box p {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .tip-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .tip-item {
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .tip-item strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--bunny);
  }

  .tip-item span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .96rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .bunny-gallery { margin-bottom: 32px; }

  .add-btn {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 13px 28px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--travel);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255,107,53,.3);
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }

  .add-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(255,107,53,.38);
  }

  .user-post {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 28px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, border-color .28s ease;
  }

  .user-post:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.14);
    border-color: rgba(255,107,53,.28);
  }

  .user-post .thumb {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface-soft), var(--surface));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 3rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .user-post .thumb img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .user-post .badge {
    position: absolute;
    right: 14px;
    bottom: 14px;
    padding: 4px 11px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(15,23,42,.72);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .user-post .post-body {
    padding: 22px 24px 28px;
  }

  .user-post .post-body h3 {
    margin: 2px 0 8px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .post-date {
    font-size: .82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .clamp {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .file-list {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .file-list a {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--travel);
    font-weight: 900;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .attach-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  #fileCount, #photoCount {
    font-size: .85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  dialog {
    margin: auto;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 0;
    width: min(680px, calc(100% - 32px));
    max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
    background: var(--surface-glass);
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgba(15,23,42,.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  body:has(dialog[open]) {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .dlg-body {
    padding: 32px;
    max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
    overflow: auto;
  }

  .dlg-title {
    padding-right: 44px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .field { margin-bottom: 18px; }

  .field label,
  .field .lbl {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: .92rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  .field input[type="text"],
  .field input[type="date"],
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px 15px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    font: inherit;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    transition: border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }

  .field textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 150px;
  }

  .field input:focus,
  .field textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--travel);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,107,53,.15);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .file-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: .92rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }

  .file-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--travel);
    color: var(--travel);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .preview-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(92px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .thumb-sm {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .thumb-sm img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .rm {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    right: 6px;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(15,23,42,.75);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .form-error {
    min-height: 1.4em;
    color: #E53E3E;
    font-size: .9rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .dlg-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 950;
    font-size: .95rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: transform .2s ease, filter .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--travel), #FF9A76);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:disabled {
    opacity: .55;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    transform: none;
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    border-color: var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .btn-danger {
    background: rgba(229,62,62,.10);
    border-color: rgba(229,62,62,.22);
    color: #E53E3E;
  }

  .x-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 18px;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(15,23,42,.08);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  #viewContent {
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    line-height: 1.85;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .view-photos {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .view-photos img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .about-section {
    background: var(--surface-soft);
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-section p {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  footer {
    background: #0F172A;
    color: #94A3B8;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 42px 20px;
    font-size: .9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  footer span {
    color: var(--bunny);
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .post-grid,
    .cat-grid,
    .bunny-gallery,
    .user-post-grid,
    .hero-cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .parallax-section { background-attachment: scroll; }
    .tip-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .menu-btn { display: inline-grid; }

    .nav-links {
      display: none;
      position: absolute;
      top: 68px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
      background: var(--surface-glass);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .post-grid,
    .cat-grid,
    .bunny-gallery,
    .user-post-grid,
    .hero-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 120px 0 90px;
    }

    .parallax-section {
      padding: 90px 0;
    }

    .dlg-body {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .hero-card {
      padding: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="container nav">
    <a href="#home" class="logo"><span class="logo-w">W</span>ayfarer<span class="logo-dot">.</span></a>

    <div class="nav-right">
      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="#home" data-nav="home">홈</a></li>
        <li><a href="#travel" data-nav="travel">🧭 여행</a></li>
        <li><a href="#repair" data-nav="repair">🖥️ 수리·상담</a></li>
        <li><a href="#bunny" data-nav="bunny">🐰 토끼 일상</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about" data-nav="about">소개</a></li>
      </ul>

      <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" aria-label="다크 모드 전환" title="다크 모드 전환">🌙</button>
      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="메뉴 열기">☰</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero parallax-section" id="home" data-view="home" style="background-image: url('1.jpg');">
  <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  <div class="overlay"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span>W</span>ayfarer · 기록하고, 고치고, 쉬어가는 곳
      </div>

      <h1>시작하라, 그럼 바뀔 것이다<br>여행을 기록하고, <em>컴퓨터</em>를 고치며, 🐰와 함께합니다</h1>

      <p>
        세상의 아름다운 풍경들을 담는 여행기부터 고장 난 컴퓨터를 시원하게 고쳐내는 팁,
        그리고 사랑스러운 애완토끼의 힐링 가득한 일상까지 모두 담았습니다.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cards">
        <a href="#travel" class="hero-card travel">
          <div class="icon">🧭</div>
          <h3>내 여행 기록</h3>
          <p>직접 발로 뛰며 다녀온 국내외 여행지와 생생한 현지 이야기들.</p>
          <span class="go">여행 기록 보기 →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#repair" class="hero-card repair">
          <div class="icon">🖥️</div>
          <h3>컴퓨터 수리·상담</h3>
          <p>머리 아픈 PC 고장 꿀팁 공유 및 맞춤형 1:1 상담 안내.</p>
          <span class="go">수리·상담 받기 →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#bunny" class="hero-card bunny">
          <div class="icon">🐰</div>
          <h3>토끼 일상</h3>
          <p>반려토끼 토토 소개, 갤러리 사진, 유익한 양육 정보 팁 모음.</p>
          <span class="go">토끼 보러 가기 →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="travel" class="parallax-section page-view" data-view="travel" style="background-image: url('2.jpg');" hidden>
  <div class="overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <a href="#home" class="back-btn">← 홈으로</a>

    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="tag travel">TRAVEL</span>
      <h2>다녀온 여행 발자국</h2>
      <button type="button" class="section-add-btn travel-add" data-category="travel">＋ 새 여행 등록</button>
    </div>

    <div class="post-grid">
      <div class="contents" id="travelUserPosts"></div>

      <div class="post">
        <div class="icon-large">🌊</div>
        <h3>부산 영도 감성 여행</h3>
        <p>흰여울문화마을 골목길 사이로 바라본 끝없는 수평선과 오션뷰 카페 탐방 기록.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="post">
        <div class="icon-large">🏙️</div>
        <h3>일본 도쿄 시티 라이프</h3>
        <p>도쿄 타워가 한눈에 보이는 명소부터 나만 알고 싶은 고요한 숨은 골목길 투어.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="post">
        <div class="icon-large">🏔️</div>
        <h3>강원도 평창 숲속 힐링</h3>
        <p>초록빛 숲 한가운데서 온전한 휴식과 자연 소리를 만끽했던 2박 3일의 주말 휴양.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="repair" class="parallax-section page-view" data-view="repair" style="background-image: url('3.jpg');" hidden>
  <div class="overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <a href="#home" class="back-btn">← 홈으로</a>

    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="tag repair">REPAIR</span>
      <h2>컴퓨터 고장 수리 & 상담</h2>
      <button type="button" class="section-add-btn repair-add" data-category="repair">＋ 새 글 등록</button>
    </div>

    <div class="user-post-grid" id="repairUserPosts"></div>

    <div class="cat-grid">
      <div class="cat">
        <div class="icon-large">⚙️</div>
        <h3>느려진 PC 포맷·